        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2800280/extras/b4c522cdf81b7e466c4f8d4d8f59da86.avif?t=1760972535\" width=700 height=1122 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2800280/extras/ec6bcc43c1a70aea80c162642c4e1694.poster.avif?t=1760972535\" width=700 height=482 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2800280/extras/ec6bcc43c1a70aea80c162642c4e1694.webm?t=1760972535\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2800280/extras/ec6bcc43c1a70aea80c162642c4e1694.mp4?t=1760972535\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Bermuda Survivor offers a fresh take on the bullet heaven genre. While your main goal is to stay alive and vanquish swarms of enemies, there will also be time for a rather calm exploration, solving lore riddles, and gathering various resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2800280/extras/e793e5c166a310473fb2928565609f69.poster.avif?t=1760972535\" width=700 height=482 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2800280/extras/e793e5c166a310473fb2928565609f69.webm?t=1760972535\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2800280/extras/e793e5c166a310473fb2928565609f69.mp4?t=1760972535\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Unlock multiple abilities and weapons as you progress. Melee or ranged, choose what suits you best: deadly katanas, bats, revolvers, shotguns, rifles, and many more await. Explore various synergies and craft powerful combos to fend off powerful bosses and defeat the hordes even faster. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2800280/extras/58d4c1d1dac055ec99a30b21d6bf62b4.poster.avif?t=1760972535\" width=700 height=482 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2800280/extras/58d4c1d1dac055ec99a30b21d6bf62b4.webm?t=1760972535\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2800280/extras/58d4c1d1dac055ec99a30b21d6bf62b4.mp4?t=1760972535\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Explore a handcrafted world filled with different paths, landmarks, and other surprises. Unlike most similar games, the layout is fixed, allowing you to master every corner and find the most efficient routes to succeed. Venture through different biomes, including a burning-hot lava lake, mysterious fog, or the void (a special endgame biome).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2800280/extras/2123c7740b08ba565fa30171e0998a6d.poster.avif?t=1760972535\" width=700 height=482 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2800280/extras/2123c7740b08ba565fa30171e0998a6d.webm?t=1760972535\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2800280/extras/2123c7740b08ba565fa30171e0998a6d.mp4?t=1760972535\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Gather new resources with every run. Use them to permanently unlock hidden paths &amp; shortcuts, restore buildings, free captured inhabitants, and power up advanced machines scattered throughout the map. Expect to have a real influence on the shape of the world and level design!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2800280/extras/197ae8e6e5b472d9be21644e1b3c5164.poster.avif?t=1760972535\" width=700 height=482 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2800280/extras/197ae8e6e5b472d9be21644e1b3c5164.webm?t=1760972535\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2800280/extras/197ae8e6e5b472d9be21644e1b3c5164.mp4?t=1760972535\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Dive deep into the Bermuda Triangle mystery and uncover its secrets. It all begins with a sudden pull into a vast vortex. Stranded on a strange island, with your ship gone and the crew nowhere to be found, your only guide is the distant signal tower on the horizon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2800280/extras/0a42e3830f504b754a1696962ee32147.poster.avif?t=1760972535\" width=700 height=482 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2800280/extras/0a42e3830f504b754a1696962ee32147.webm?t=1760972535\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2800280/extras/0a42e3830f504b754a1696962ee32147.mp4?t=1760972535\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Try to find your scattered crewmates; each changed in strange, unpredictable ways. Hear their stories, help them, and uncover what drove them to madness. Be ready to encounter the bizarre and the unexpected: from strange lights in the sky to raccoons with katanas, feral chickens, and… giant tanks? Each run brings as many new questions as answers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2800280/extras/fde91fe507bd66f82f600ac3f1c7df9d.avif?t=1760972535\" width=700 height=352 /></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2800280/extras/b4c522cdf81b7e466c4f8d4d8f59da86.avif?t=1760972535\" width=700 height=1122 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2800280/extras/ec6bcc43c1a70aea80c162642c4e1694.poster.avif?t=1760972535\" width=700 height=482 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2800280/extras/ec6bcc43c1a70aea80c162642c4e1694.webm?t=1760972535\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2800280/extras/ec6bcc43c1a70aea80c162642c4e1694.mp4?t=1760972535\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Bermuda Survivor offers a fresh take on the bullet heaven genre. While your main goal is to stay alive and vanquish swarms of enemies, there will also be time for a rather calm exploration, solving lore riddles, and gathering various resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2800280/extras/e793e5c166a310473fb2928565609f69.poster.avif?t=1760972535\" width=700 height=482 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2800280/extras/e793e5c166a310473fb2928565609f69.webm?t=1760972535\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2800280/extras/e793e5c166a310473fb2928565609f69.mp4?t=1760972535\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Unlock multiple abilities and weapons as you progress. Melee or ranged, choose what suits you best: deadly katanas, bats, revolvers, shotguns, rifles, and many more await. Explore various synergies and craft powerful combos to fend off powerful bosses and defeat the hordes even faster. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2800280/extras/58d4c1d1dac055ec99a30b21d6bf62b4.poster.avif?t=1760972535\" width=700 height=482 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2800280/extras/58d4c1d1dac055ec99a30b21d6bf62b4.webm?t=1760972535\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2800280/extras/58d4c1d1dac055ec99a30b21d6bf62b4.mp4?t=1760972535\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Explore a handcrafted world filled with different paths, landmarks, and other surprises. Unlike most similar games, the layout is fixed, allowing you to master every corner and find the most efficient routes to succeed. Venture through different biomes, including a burning-hot lava lake, mysterious fog, or the void (a special endgame biome).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2800280/extras/2123c7740b08ba565fa30171e0998a6d.poster.avif?t=1760972535\" width=700 height=482 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2800280/extras/2123c7740b08ba565fa30171e0998a6d.webm?t=1760972535\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2800280/extras/2123c7740b08ba565fa30171e0998a6d.mp4?t=1760972535\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Gather new resources with every run. Use them to permanently unlock hidden paths &amp; shortcuts, restore buildings, free captured inhabitants, and power up advanced machines scattered throughout the map. Expect to have a real influence on the shape of the world and level design!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2800280/extras/197ae8e6e5b472d9be21644e1b3c5164.poster.avif?t=1760972535\" width=700 height=482 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2800280/extras/197ae8e6e5b472d9be21644e1b3c5164.webm?t=1760972535\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2800280/extras/197ae8e6e5b472d9be21644e1b3c5164.mp4?t=1760972535\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Dive deep into the Bermuda Triangle mystery and uncover its secrets. It all begins with a sudden pull into a vast vortex. Stranded on a strange island, with your ship gone and the crew nowhere to be found, your only guide is the distant signal tower on the horizon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2800280/extras/0a42e3830f504b754a1696962ee32147.poster.avif?t=1760972535\" width=700 height=482 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2800280/extras/0a42e3830f504b754a1696962ee32147.webm?t=1760972535\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2800280/extras/0a42e3830f504b754a1696962ee32147.mp4?t=1760972535\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Try to find your scattered crewmates; each changed in strange, unpredictable ways. Hear their stories, help them, and uncover what drove them to madness. Be ready to encounter the bizarre and the unexpected: from strange lights in the sky to raccoons with katanas, feral chickens, and… giant tanks? Each run brings as many new questions as answers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2800280/extras/fde91fe507bd66f82f600ac3f1c7df9d.avif?t=1760972535\" width=700 height=352 /></span></p>",
